---
import Icon from './Icon.astro';
---

<section class="project-offer" aria-labelledby="offer-heading">
  <div class="container section offer-grid">
    <div class="offer-copy">
      <p class="eyebrow">A focused first project</p>
      <h2 id="offer-heading">
        You don’t need to rebuild everything.
        <br />
        <em>Fix the part holding you back.</em>
      </h2>
      <p>
        Start with the report you keep rebuilding, the follow-up that gets missed or the website
        that undersells your business. We’ll define one useful improvement and the work needed to
        deliver it.
      </p>
      <a class="button" href="/contact/">
        Tell me what’s slowing you down <Icon name="arrow" size={19} />
      </a>
      <p class="offer-small">
        No finished brief needed. Tell me what happens today and what you want to change.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="offer-document">
      <div class="offer-document-head">
        <span>YOUR FIRST IMPROVEMENT</span>
        <Icon name="file" size={24} />
      </div>
      <h3>
        A clear result.
        <br />A defined way to get there.
      </h3>
      <ol>
        <li>
          <span>01</span>
          <div>
            <strong>A scope you can say yes to.</strong>
            <p>
              The problem, agreed deliverables, boundaries and proposed cost before development
              starts.
            </p>
          </div>
        </li>
        <li>
          <span>02</span>
          <div>
            <strong>Something you can review.</strong>
            <p>
              See the work as it takes shape. Check it against the situations your team actually
              faces.
            </p>
          </div>
        </li>
        <li>
          <span>03</span>
          <div>
            <strong>A handover you can use.</strong>
            <p>Know how it works, who owns it and what to do when something needs attention.</p>
          </div>
        </li>
      </ol>
      <div class="offer-signoff">
        <span class="avatar-monogram">KS</span>
        <div>
          <strong>Karol Songin</strong>
          <span>The person you speak to is the person building it.</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
